        {
          "title": "USB 止痒器",
          "content": "<p>市场上出现了一种奇特的 USB 设备，当你被蚊虫叮咬后，它可以用来止痒。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202312/bg2023121911.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>你把它插入手机的 USB-C 口，然后用 App 可以控制它的发热。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202312/bg2023121912.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>当它发热以后，将其贴在被咬处，等同于热敷，很快就不痒了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202312/bg2023121910.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这么一个小玩意，在亚马逊的售价居然为30英镑（270元人民币）。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "USB 止痒器",
              "url": "https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2023/12/usb-c-cures-mosquito-bites/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202312/bg2023121911.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202312/bg2023121912.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202312/bg2023121910.webp"
